OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for murder of woman    
OL,4,Adrowned in Thames                      
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for life with a  
OL,7,Fminimum of 22 years and six months     
OL,8,Fafter he murdered a woman, who was     
OL,9,Ffound drowned in the River Thames,     
OL,10,Fwhile serving a suspended prison       
OL,11,Fsentence.                              
OL,13,FThe body of Jennifer Symonds, 44, was  
OL,14,Frecovered from the river at Phyllis    
OL,15,FCourt Club in Henley-on-Thames on the  
OL,16,Fmorning of 6 March 2026.               
OL,18,FLast month, Nelio Gouveia, 45, of      
OL,19,FPhyllis Court Drive, Henley-on-Thames, 
OL,20,Fpleaded guilty to her murder during an 
OL,21,Fappearance at Oxford Crown Court.      
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
