OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for murder of woman    
OL,4,Adrowned in Thames                      
OL,6,FDuring a hearing at the same court on  
OL,7,FFriday, Gouveia was handed the         
OL,8,Fmandatory life sentence for murder and 
OL,9,Fordered to serve at least 22 years and 
OL,10,Fsix months behind bars.                
